<title>UK: Iraq Ceyhan/Mina al-Bakr export schedule - update.</title>
<headline>Iraq Ceyhan/Mina al-Bakr export schedule - update.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are schedules for loadings of Iraqi Kirkuk crude from Turkey's Ceyhan and of Basrah Light from Iraq's Gulf port Mina al-Bakr.</p>
<p>Ceyhan:</p>
<p>Tanker		     Date   Volume     Buyer</p>
<p>				     (million bbls)</p>
<p>Arcadia		    14/8    2.10	Bayoil/US</p>
<p>New Horizon		15/8    1.00	Coastal/US</p>
<p>Landsort		   16/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>Tromso Fidelity	  17/8    1.00	Coastal/US</p>
<p>Chickasaw		  18/8    1.00	Repsol/Spain</p>
<p>Mega Point		 20/8    0.90	Chevron/US</p>
<p>by pipeline		20/8    0.65	Tupras/Turkey</p>
<p>TBN			  22/8    0.45	Rosneft/Russia</p>
<p>Macedonia		  23/8    0.97	Elf/France</p>
<p>Nord-Jahre Transporter 24/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>Front Climber	    25/8    1.00	Cepsa/Spain</p>
<p>TBN			  25/8    1.00	Agip/Italy</p>
<p>by pipeline		25/8    0.65	Tupras/Turkey</p>
<p>Biruinta		   27/8    0.97	OMV/Austria</p>
<p>Marble		     28/8    1.00	Total/France</p>
<p>Kuzbass		    29/8    1.00	Repsol/Spain</p>
<p>TBN			  30/8    0.90	to be announced</p>
<p>Kalkavan		   30/8    1.025     to be announced</p>
<p>Queen of Lausanne	31/8    0.90	Trafigura/Netherlands</p>
<p>Sub-total			   17.515 (925,000 barrels per day)</p>
<p>Mina al-Bakr:</p>
<p>Stena Companion	 20/8     2.42	Coastal/US</p>
<p>Jahre Ventura	   18/8     2.65	Bayoil/US</p>
<p>Red Seagull	     --/8     2.54	Coastal/US</p>
<p>TBN			 29/8     2.00	Chevron/US</p>
<p>TBN			 29/8     0.60	Nafta/Russian</p>
<p>TBN			  1/9     1.00	Mobil/US</p>
<p>Sub-total			   11.21 (560,000 barrels per day)</p>
<p>Total				 28.725 (1.45 million barrels per day)</p>
<p>TBN =  to be nominated</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
